### 📁 Project Overview

**TimeLine 2026** is a comprehensive countdown visualization platform for tracking important dates in 2026, including:
- Chinese public holidays (7 major holidays)
- Professional certification exams (30+ exams)
- Civil service exams (national/provincial/city levels)
- Custom personal events

### 🏗️ Technical Stack

- **Framework**: Next.js 14 (App Router)
- **Language**: TypeScript 5.x
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS + CSS Variables
- **State Management**: Zustand
- **Icons**: Lucide React
- **Animations**: Framer Motion
- **Date Utilities**: date-fns

### ✨ All 12 Major Features Implemented

1. ✅ **Homepage Timeline Display** - Chronological event timeline with collapsible "Ended Events"
2. ✅ **Event Card Component** - Rich information display with hover effects
3. ✅ **Filtering & Search** - Multi-level filtering with real-time search
4. ✅ **Favorites System** - Persistent favorites with localStorage
5. ✅ **Theme Toggle** - Light/dark mode with system preference detection
6. ✅ **Annual Progress Bar** - Visual year progress with gradient
7. ✅ **Event Detail Modal** - Complete event information with animations
8. ✅ **Custom Event Addition** - Full CRUD operations for personal events
9. ✅ **Responsive Design** - Mobile/tablet/desktop layouts
10. ✅ **SEO Optimization** - Meta tags and Open Graph
11. ✅ **Civil Service Exam Filters** - National/provincial/city level filtering
12. ✅ **Enhanced Custom Events** - Repeat support, reminders, editing

