### Project Overview

**TimeLine 2026** is a modern Next.js 14 application for tracking 2026 countdown events including Chinese holidays and professional exams.

**Tech Stack**:
- Next.js 14 (App Router) with TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS with dark mode
- Zustand state management with localStorage persistence
- Framer Motion animations
- Lucide React icons
- date-fns for date calculations

**Key Features Implemented** (All 60):
- ✅ Homepage timeline with all events sorted by date
- ✅ Collapsible "Ended Events" section for past events
- ✅ Urgent visual emphasis (fire icon) for events within 7 days
- ✅ Quarter-based grouping (Q1-Q4)
- ✅ Event card hover animations
- ✅ Event filtering (by type and status)
- ✅ Search functionality
- ✅ Favorites system with localStorage persistence
- ✅ Dark/light theme toggle with system preference detection
- ✅ Annual progress bar showing year completion percentage
- ✅ Custom event creation (modal form)
- ✅ Responsive design (mobile, tablet, desktop)
- ✅ SEO optimization (metadata, Open Graph)
- ✅ Performance optimization (static generation, image optimization)
- ✅ Accessibility (keyboard navigation, ARIA labels, semantic HTML)
- ✅ Professional UI design (gradient backgrounds, shadows, smooth transitions)
- ✅ Footer with copyright and links
- ✅ Various aesthetic enhancements (status badges, icons, visual hierarchy)

